dt>Damage</dt><dd>34&ndash;51</dd></div>\n      \n        <div><dt>Weight</dt><dd>4.0</dd></div>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n    </dl>\n\n    \n      <h2>Usable by</h2>\n      <p>\n        <a class=\"pill\" href=\"/items?class=44\">Blood Mage</a>\n      \n        <a class=\"pill\" href=\"/items?class=7\">Druid</a>\n      \n        <a class=\"pill\" href=\"/items?class=45\">Necromancer</a>\n      \n        <a class=\"pill\" href=\"/items?class=14\">Psionicist</a>\n      \n        <a class=\"pill\" href=\"/items?class=25\">Sorcerer</a>\n      </p>\n    \n\n    \n    \n\n    \n\n    \n\n    \n\n    \n      <h2>Stats</h2>\n      <ul class=\"plain\">\n        \n          <li>\n            <a href=\"/items?stat=262\">Wisdom</a>\n            <span class=\"muted\">&nbsp;11</span>\n            <span class=\"pill\" title=\"Game enum code\">WISDOM</span>\n          </li>\n        \n      </ul>\n    \n\n    \n      <h2>Effects</h2>\n      <p>\n          <a href=\"/items?effect=11\"><strong>Amateur Artificer</strong></a>\n          <span class=\"pill\">crafting origin</span><br>\n          <span class=\"muted\">Amateur Artificer</span>\n        </p>\n      <p>\n          <a href=\"/items?effect=44\"><strong>Arcane Barb IV</strong></a>\n          <span class=\"pill\">activated</span><br>\n          <span class=\"muted\">Arcane Barb IV</span>\n        </p>\n      \n    \n  </div>\n\n  <div>\n    \n\n    \n      <h2>As recorded</h2>\n      <div class=\"tooltip\">Item level 21\nPrimary Hand (Two Handed)\nDamage ??\n 3.1 Speed (DPS)\n+11 Wisdom\nActivated Effect: Arcane Barb IV\nClass: DRU BMG NEC PSI SOR\nQalian Style \nCrafting: Amateur Artificer\nWeight: 4</div>\n    \n\n    \n      <h2>Description</h2>\n      <p>Damage ?? 3.1 Speed (DPS) Qalian Style</p>\n    \n\n    \n  </div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  <h2 style=\"margin-top:30px\">Sources</h2>\n  \n    <p>\n      The stats above were read from <a href=\"htt