>Vanguard: Saga of Heroes</em>,\n    which closed in 2014. Nothing here is our own work &mdash; it was written by\n    the community over many years and is reproduced so it does not disappear.\n  </p>\n  \n  <p class=\"muted credits\">\n    With thanks to\n    <a href=\"https://vgoplayers.com/\" rel=\"noreferrer nofollow\">VGOPlayers</a>,\n    Vanguard Item Database,\n    <a href=\"https://www.vgoemulator.net/\" rel=\"noreferrer nofollow\">the VGO Emulator team</a>,\n    <a href=\"http://thetelonproject.wikidot.com/\" rel=\"noreferrer nofollow\">The Telon Project</a>,\n    The Steel Warrior,\n    Vanguard Crafters,\n    MMODB,\n    Curse,\n    <a href=\"http://wiki.silkyvenom.com/\" rel=\"noreferrer nofollow\">Silky Venom</a>,\n    the IGN Vanguard Vault,\n    Monkly Business,\n    <a href=\"https://vanguard.gamepressure.com/\" rel=\"noreferrer nofollow\">gamepressure</a>,\n    Vanguard Shaman,\n    DungeonGuru,\n    <a href=\"https://www.tentonhammer.com/\" rel=\"noreferrer nofollow\">Ten Ton Hammer</a>,\n    Vanguard Fighters,\n    Lost Company,\n    the Station forums,\n    <a href=\"https://vanguard.fandom.com/\" rel=\"noreferrer nofollow\">the Vanguard Wiki</a>,\n    The Safe House,\n    VG Rangers,\n    Xanadu,\n    Vanguard Guide,\n    VG Walkthroughs,\n    Vanguard Spheres,\n    Gonzwerks,\n    vgtact,\n    Covenant of the Phoenix,\n    Aradrin,\n    Angry Goblins\n    and ZAM.\n  </p>\n  <p class=\"muted\">\n    \n    \n    Built 2026-10-10.\n  </p>\n</footer>\n<script type=\"module\" src=\"https://static.cloudflareinsights.com/beacon.min.js/v4bc70e2c01a94c73b74392e4234840661791215815920\" integrity=\"sha512-L0ha0OXavK/8okipN9F8BtP84dg9DUhPERbBXzwI6dgTA55d2+yweo3pn5CSFYs45/r8md2+xvUPtTdvTNRfjA==\" data-cf-beacon='{\"version\":\"2024.11.0\",\"token\":\"4444388935c44f409f6a42889afc6ca0\",\"r\":1,\"spa\":2}' crossorigin=\"anonymous\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>",
